= Title

Hello, world!
This is the first text written in :[code]{Orische}.
:[code]{Orische} is a lightweight markup language for writing structured documents with simple and consistent syntax.

== Inline Elements

Text can contain :[em]{emphasised content} to highlight an important phrase.

Inline code can be written with a code span, such as :[code]{orische input.ori}.

Links can include readable text:
:[link:https://github.com/kanisper/Orische]{Visit the Orische repository}

Inline elements can also be nested:
:[em]{Orische can contain :[code]{inline code} inside emphasised text.}

== Lists

Orische supports unordered lists.

* Simple syntax
* Clear document structure
* Extensible block and inline elements
** Block directives
** Inline directives
*** Emphasis
*** Code spans
*** Links
* HTML rendering

Ordered lists are also supported.

